WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
Episode 18

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
Floating Fortress Island<i>!
</i>Suicidal Assault Team of Two<i>!!</i>

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:04.520
( Air date: Feb 02, 1975 )

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.150
Space Battleship

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:40.150
<i>YAMATO</i>

00:01:33.910 --> 00:01:41.270
In 2199, Earth was attacked by Meteor
Bombs from the mysterious planet Gamilus...

00:01:41.270 --> 00:01:45.870
{SONO}...and mankind was facing extinction in one
year due to the radioactive contamination.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:02:01.560
{CHIKYUU}The space battleship Yamato, the first
Earth ship to exceed the speed of light...

00:02:01.560 --> 00:02:04.710
{CHIKYUU}...has left for Iscandar to
obtain the radioactive purifier.

00:02:09.960 --> 00:02:12.710
Galactic System

00:02:10.090 --> 00:02:15.660
Iscandar is 148,000 light years
away in the Large Magellanic Cloud.

00:02:14.240 --> 00:02:16.790
Large Magellanic Cloud

00:02:16.970 --> 00:02:20.960
{GENZAI}Their current destination is
the mid point, planet Balan.

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.910
{YAMATO}Balan appears to be a beacon
in space for the Yamato...

00:02:23.910 --> 00:02:27.640
{YAMATO}...but it's also a Gamilus supply
base for the invasion of Earth.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:29.760
Planet Balan

00:02:30.070 --> 00:02:32.310
{Domel}After being assigned as commander of
the Solar System region operations...

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:37.310
{Domel}...a famed admiral, Domel, has just
arrived on planet Balan with his fleet.

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.860
{BALAN}Using Balan as
his main base...

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:44.640
{BALAN}...Admiral Domel is like a space wolf
sharpening its fangs to kill the Yamato.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:47.180
Admiral Domel

00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:50.630
The Yamato is 8 days
away from planet Balan.

00:03:01.560 --> 00:03:05.270
Distance to the unknown object
is 20,000 km. No effect so far.

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.840
Kodai, you've sent
a scout plane, right ?

00:03:08.840 --> 00:03:10.820
Yes, sir.
It's approaching right now.

00:03:14.890 --> 00:03:18.860
Recon K62 to Yamato.
Recon K62 to Yamato.

00:03:19.790 --> 00:03:22.910
This is Yamato.
K62, go ahead.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:28.110
K62 is 1000 km from the
unknown object.  No change, over.

00:03:28.110 --> 00:03:29.980
Good.
Keep approaching.

00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:39.860
Recon K62,
what happened ?!

00:03:39.860 --> 00:03:42.060
Respond !
Come in, come in !

00:03:48.190 --> 00:03:49.310
What do you think ?

00:03:49.310 --> 00:03:52.110
Do you see how
unusual the explosion is ?

00:03:52.590 --> 00:03:54.030
What do you think, Kodai ?

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:58.420
It was more like it was
disassembled rather than blown up.

00:03:58.420 --> 00:04:00.210
That's right.  Let's take
a look one more time.

00:04:06.610 --> 00:04:08.720
It must be a
magnetron wave.

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:11.780
And it's coming from
that unknown object.

00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.670
What do you mean ?

00:04:13.670 --> 00:04:17.480
It's a Gamilus fortress.
No doubt about it.

00:04:17.480 --> 00:04:19.290
Can't we go around it ?

00:04:19.290 --> 00:04:20.810
No, we can't.

00:04:20.810 --> 00:04:23.420
I changed our course to 9 o'clock,
but it's following us.

00:04:24.860 --> 00:04:26.530
I'll leave it to Mr. Sanada.

00:04:26.530 --> 00:04:30.420
Yes, sir. I will carry out the mission
to destroy the enemy fortress.

00:04:31.320 --> 00:04:35.020
A seamless fighter has already
been built in the factory.

00:04:35.020 --> 00:04:37.640
Captain, please let
me go with him.

00:04:37.640 --> 00:04:39.720
You think I'm incapable ?

00:04:39.720 --> 00:04:41.560
No, I don't mean
that, Mr. Sanada.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:44.320
I lost two of my subordinates
in that scout plane.

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:46.420
I don't want you
to be next victim.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:26.980
Just like you, Chief Engineer Sanada.
I wish you could've built this earlier.

00:05:28.130 --> 00:05:29.530
What's wrong, Mr. Sanada ?

00:05:40.510 --> 00:05:42.310
The shape is smooth oval.

00:05:42.310 --> 00:05:45.380
Length is about 1 km.
Height is about 300 meters.

00:05:45.380 --> 00:05:48.460
It's like a giant pumice
stone floating in space.

00:05:48.460 --> 00:05:50.310
There are number of
holes on the surface...

00:05:50.310 --> 00:05:53.270
...and they're assumed to be the
magnetron wave emitters. Over.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:58.860
Alright. The magnetron wave has started
affecting the Yamato a little, so be careful.

00:05:58.860 --> 00:05:59.930
Roger.

00:06:00.460 --> 00:06:05.900
Kodai, the fortress is in our range.
Try shooting an emitter with the laser gun.

00:06:05.900 --> 00:06:06.720
Roger.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:15.490
What the...?
It closed.

00:06:15.490 --> 00:06:17.110
As I thought.

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:21.760
It has an automatic shutter, which
senses vibrations and acts quickly.

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:26.310
The fortress is well prepared
against an external attack.

00:06:26.310 --> 00:06:30.970
In order to destroy the fortress,
we have to sneak inside.

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.860
Kodai and Sanada will leave the seamless
plane and attempt to enter the fortress.

00:06:36.930 --> 00:06:39.400
We'll be out of contact
for a while. Over.

00:06:40.520 --> 00:06:44.420
Alright. Be very careful.
That's all.

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:54.920
Are you alright, Kodai ?

00:06:54.920 --> 00:06:55.880
I'm fine.

00:06:56.240 --> 00:06:57.070
Good.

00:07:40.290 --> 00:07:41.460
It's like a maze.

00:07:51.990 --> 00:07:53.110
Kodai.

00:07:55.110 --> 00:07:58.220
I have something I need
you to forgive me for.

00:07:58.220 --> 00:07:59.860
What do you need to tell
me in a place like this ?{ is it,
in a place like this ?}

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.030
It's about your brother.

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:07.390
Your brother Kodai Mamoru and
I were classmates at the academy.

00:08:17.010 --> 00:08:23.010
Although your brother was popular and
I was quiet, strangely, we got along well.

00:08:26.220 --> 00:08:30.010
{YAGATE}After the academy, your
brother became a pilot...

00:08:30.010 --> 00:08:34.410
{YAGATE}...and I was assigned to ground
work, and we were separated.

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:39.650
{SONO}But we were reunited 9 months ago, when
the space destroyer Yukikaze docked.

00:08:40.470 --> 00:08:45.810
{KODAI}Kodai Mamoru was the Yukikaze's captain,
and I was the chief engineer of Dock 3.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:48.410
{FUNE}His ship was heavily damaged.

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:53.410
{FUNE}The Earth Defense Force was no match
for Gamilus's superior technology.

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.810
How is it ?
Can I go and fight ?

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:00.870
Oh, sure...

00:09:00.870 --> 00:09:03.340
I see.  I'll leave
in three days.

00:09:03.340 --> 00:09:05.410
It's for the
Pluto front line.

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:08.420
If we're defeated,
Earth will have no chance.

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:26.550
That was the last
time I saw him.

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:32.270
The final battle of the Earth Defense
Force at Pluto was very difficult...

00:09:32.270 --> 00:09:35.570
...and only Captain Okita's
flagship was able to return.

00:09:36.860 --> 00:09:40.860
{KODAI}I heard that Mamoru's Yukikaze acted as a
shield to let the Commander, Okita, escape...

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.550
{KODAI}...and died a heroic death.

00:09:45.090 --> 00:09:49.670
{DAGA}But I knew that the Yukikaze
didn't have any other choice.

00:09:49.670 --> 00:09:51.760
{ANO}The ship was
already a wreck...

00:09:51.760 --> 00:09:55.810
{ANO}...and I couldn't repair the Yukikaze
enough so that it could return to Earth.

00:09:55.810 --> 00:10:00.200
{OMAE}I feel like I'm responsible
for Kodai Mamoru's death.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.760
I see.

00:10:03.690 --> 00:10:09.220
Every time I see your face, I remember Kodai
Mamoru's face, and it makes my heart ache.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:10.960
It wasn't your fault.

00:10:10.960 --> 00:10:13.760
Besides, it's about the past,
so let's forget about it.

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.150
Even I was...

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:30.410
It was bad timing to
talk about your brother.

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:35.760
However, even a Chief Combat
Commander can drop his guard, huh ?

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:38.470
I feel better.

00:10:39.470 --> 00:10:44.960
{TEISATSU}When I saw the remains of the scout
plane, I remembered my sister.

00:10:46.620 --> 00:10:50.010
{KAZOKU}It was when my family went to
an amusement park on the Moon.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.260
I was a grade
school student.

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:56.290
{SORE}But I insisted on
piloting a rocket car.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:24.660
Distracted by family,
when I'm not supposed to be.

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.350
I guess
it's not just me.

00:11:26.350 --> 00:11:28.860
That's normal for a human.

00:11:28.860 --> 00:11:30.170
Yes, that's true.

00:11:48.520 --> 00:11:51.660
Top panel no. 1
on the bow came off.

00:11:52.680 --> 00:11:55.210
I hope Kodai and
Chief Engineer Sanada...

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:59.640
...can stop the magnetron wave
before the Yamato breaks apart.

00:12:12.300 --> 00:12:14.010
We've been walking
for more than 5 km.

00:12:14.010 --> 00:12:17.290
There're so many passages.
Where is the end ?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:18.990
Here.

00:12:19.950 --> 00:12:22.250
This fortress
is totally unmanned.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:25.120
In other words, this whole fortress
is a computer-operated robot.

00:12:25.120 --> 00:12:31.670
After walking around, I noticed that these
passages are similar to computer circuits.

00:12:31.670 --> 00:12:37.090
And I just found the answer.
This is the heart we have to destroy.

00:13:05.470 --> 00:13:11.910
So, according to your calculations, the
chance of a successful warp is only 55%.

00:13:11.910 --> 00:13:13.410
Yes, sir.

00:13:13.410 --> 00:13:15.010
The moment to enter warp
is very dangerous...

00:13:15.010 --> 00:13:17.960
...because we'll be strongly
affected by the magnetron wave.

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:22.120
But at this rate, we'll be
dragged into its effective range.

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.920
But what about
Kodai and Sanada ?

00:13:27.510 --> 00:13:29.720
Shima, prepare for a warp.

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:32.410
Aye, sir.

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:44.410
I liked painting
when I was a kid.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:49.000
So I wanted to be a painter once
I grew up, but look at me...

00:13:50.270 --> 00:13:51.960
I'm a professional scientist.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:54.760
It's because I lost my
sister in that accident.

00:13:56.660 --> 00:14:00.420
Machines kill humans.
That's unbelievable.

00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:06.880
Science should contribute to humanity,
and humanity is superior to science.

00:14:06.880 --> 00:14:11.160
I believed so, and I became
a scientist to prove it.

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:13.860
Science is my
enemy to defeat.

00:14:36.470 --> 00:14:37.120
Dammit !

00:15:25.470 --> 00:15:28.160
Warp preparations are complete.

00:15:29.140 --> 00:15:29.760
Very well.

00:15:42.050 --> 00:15:42.480
Kodai !

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:43.860
Kodai !

00:15:44.740 --> 00:15:45.370
Kodai !

00:15:46.240 --> 00:15:47.150
Kodai !

00:15:53.270 --> 00:15:55.050
You're alive, Kodai.

00:15:55.960 --> 00:15:58.420
Stand up, Kodai.
Stand up and walk.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:00.270
You can move...

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:04.960
Kodai, it's an emergency.
The Yamato might warp.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.460
Say what ?

00:16:07.550 --> 00:16:09.860
The fortress's functions
are occupied by it.

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:11.010
It's our chance, Kodai.

00:16:11.010 --> 00:16:13.520
Come over here, and
cut of my arms and legs.

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.610
We don't have time !
Hurry !

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:22.110
The computer probably thinks that it has
won by restraining my arms and legs...

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:27.060
{ORE}...but I'm like a lizard, cutting off its leg or tail
to survive and defeat the enemy in the end !

00:16:27.060 --> 00:16:29.110
{SAA}Hurry and cut off
my arms and legs !

00:16:29.110 --> 00:16:30.640
Even if you ask me to,
I don't have a knife.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:31.760
You don't need one.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.300
Unscrew the bolts.

00:16:34.410 --> 00:16:35.120
Bolts ?

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.960
My arms and legs are artificial.
Unscrew the bolts on my elbow.

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.820
{ORE}If you follow my instruction,
you can separate it. Hurry.

00:16:46.820 --> 00:16:51.590
The accident took the life of my
sister as well as my arms and legs.

00:16:51.590 --> 00:16:54.340
I despise science,
which is so overrated.

00:16:58.340 --> 00:17:00.520
Turn right at the
next corner. Hurry.

00:17:16.470 --> 00:17:17.970
Good, put me down here.

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.720
Aren't we gonna get
in the seamless plane ?

00:17:19.720 --> 00:17:22.660
Put me down next to
the wall before that.

00:17:25.100 --> 00:17:29.010
Kodai, leave the fortress with
the plane as soon as possible.

00:17:29.010 --> 00:17:30.790
I'll stay.

00:17:32.010 --> 00:17:36.390
No way.
What're you going to do ?

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.010
Listen carefully.

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:43.760
The arms and legs I left at the
computer are my trump cards.

00:17:45.090 --> 00:17:47.360
Bombs are
installed in them.

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.110
The triggering device
is installed in my arm.

00:17:52.110 --> 00:17:56.760
I'll operate it, and the computer will die, and
the space fortress will cease functioning.

00:17:56.760 --> 00:17:59.920
But if I go any farther,
I won't be able to trigger it.

00:17:59.920 --> 00:18:02.240
Mr. Sanada, you're so...

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:06.960
Don't jump to conclusions, Kodai.
I'm not rushing to my death.

00:18:10.520 --> 00:18:16.090
The magnetron emitter is protected by a
shutter, which is activated by a strong shock.

00:18:16.090 --> 00:18:21.070
{HYOTTO}It might be activated by an
explosion inside, and that's my hope.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:28.960
{ORE}I'll activate it.  If I'm lucky,
I'll be able to survive.

00:18:28.960 --> 00:18:31.550
{DAGA}But Kodai, you don't
have to risk yourself.

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.850
{TOOKU}Withdraw to a safe distance,
and watch the explosion of the fortress.

00:18:34.850 --> 00:18:40.240
{SONO KI}You can come search for me, if you like.
You might be able to find one of my bones.

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:43.890
Mr. Sanada...
I don't know what to say.

00:18:55.980 --> 00:18:57.590
Well then, Mr. Sanada...

00:18:57.590 --> 00:18:58.560
Take care of yourself.

00:18:59.400 --> 00:19:00.960
I won't say goodbye.

00:19:00.960 --> 00:19:01.960
Me neither.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:35.720
Shima, commence warp.

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.520
Aye, sir.
Commence warp.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.860
Seamless plane to Yamato.
Seamless plane to Yamato.

00:19:45.860 --> 00:19:46.940
This is Kodai.

00:19:46.940 --> 00:19:48.960
Kodai to Yamato...
Kodai to Yamato...

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.010
Kodai...

00:19:57.460 --> 00:19:59.410
Kodai, is that you, Kodai ?

00:19:59.410 --> 00:20:03.270
This is Okita of the Yamato.
What's your status, Kodai ?

00:20:03.270 --> 00:20:05.920
Explosives are set.
Attempting to destroy it now.

00:20:31.310 --> 00:20:32.220
Mr. Sanada...

00:20:37.470 --> 00:20:39.560
This is Kodai.
Detonation complete.

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.460
I'll go rescue
Chief Engineer Sanada. Over.

00:20:53.490 --> 00:20:54.110
Mr. Sanada !

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.120
Mr. Sanada !

00:21:01.010 --> 00:21:01.880
Mr. Sanada !

00:21:08.270 --> 00:21:10.030
Mr. Sanada !  Mr. Sanada !

00:21:11.810 --> 00:21:12.700
Kodai !

00:21:14.890 --> 00:21:15.750
Mr. Sanada !

00:21:37.460 --> 00:21:40.800
Planet Balan

00:21:46.420 --> 00:21:49.470
Gamilus Headquarters

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:55.470
Command Room

00:22:04.560 --> 00:22:07.960
Your lighter is just like
Space Fortress No.13.

00:22:07.960 --> 00:22:09.710
In other words,
it's useless.

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:35.770
Mr. Sanada.

00:22:36.140 --> 00:22:38.610
Your injury doesn't
seem so bad.

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:40.690
Of course not.

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:43.520
Mr. Sanada...

00:22:43.520 --> 00:22:50.860
...when I found you in the flames, I felt like
my brother was still alive somewhere.

00:22:50.860 --> 00:22:52.850
Maybe so.

00:22:52.850 --> 00:22:55.380
Where ?

00:22:55.380 --> 00:22:59.010
Kodai Mamoru is alive,
especially inside your heart.

00:23:12.160 --> 00:23:14.410
Ninety-seven days have passed
since their departure from Earth.

00:23:14.410 --> 00:23:17.640
There are seven more days
to the mid point, planet Balan.

00:23:17.640 --> 00:23:19.510
Hurry to Iscandar, Yamato.

00:23:19.510 --> 00:23:23.920
Earth is waiting...
Waiting for your return.

00:23:23.920 --> 00:23:28.180
Mankind will be extinct in
260 days due to the Gamilus attack.

00:23:28.180 --> 00:23:32.760
Only 260 days left until
the extinction of mankind.

00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:38.500
260 days left until the destruction of Earth

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.300
Okita Juzo:

00:23:41.080 --> 00:23:46.300
Naya Goro

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:51.810
Mori Yuki:

00:23:46.590 --> 00:23:51.810
Asagami Yoko

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:57.320
Sanada Shiro:

00:23:52.090 --> 00:23:57.320
Aono Takeshi

00:23:57.610 --> 00:24:07.110
Note:
The narrator says ninety-seven days, but it's actually January 20th, the 103rd day. The Yamato is 8 days away from Balan, and it was stopped by a space fortress.

00:24:07.110 --> 00:24:17.110
Note:
From Sanada's flashback, the battle of Pluto took place around April or May of 2199. Also, Sanada's past was revealed.

00:24:17.110 --> 00:24:27.110
Note:
Shima worries about Kodai and Sanada. According to the storyboard, Shima goes to the bathroom later, and the cells were drawn, but the scene was omitted.

00:24:27.110 --> 00:24:33.060
Note:
We now know from the last scene,
that Yamato's uniform has a zipper on
the front center.

00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:40.240
Translation

00:24:33.640 --> 00:24:40.240
Editing

00:24:40.240 --> 00:24:47.810
Timing

00:24:40.240 --> 00:24:47.810
Song Translations

00:24:47.810 --> 00:24:52.760
A
